  "title": "10. DELETE rows",
  "prompt": "DELETE removes rows that match WHERE. Without WHERE it would remove every row.\n\nRemove the student named Dev.\n\nThe check runs after your statement and lists the names still in students.",
  "starterQuery": "DELETE FROM students\nWHERE ",
  "solutionQuery": "DELETE FROM students WHERE name = 'Dev';",
